data: {"id": "cad943094bad4a91-thinking-parallel_evidence-823", "run_id": "cad943094bad4a91", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实、冲突与缺口\n\n### 事实（支持/定位）\n\n1. **Pod 生命周期一致为 Pending / ContainerCreating**\n   - `kubectl_describe`：Pod 处于 Pending，Reason=`ContainerCreating`，节点=node2。\n   - `kubectl_events`：重复出现 `NoNetworkFound` / `FailedCreatePodSandBox`，持续 97 分钟，累计 ~422 次事件。\n   - `execute_pod_promql`：`kube_pod_status_phase=Pending(1)`，`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=ContainerCreating(1)`，重启=0。\n   - `kubectl_get_yaml`：phase=Pending，containerStatuses[app].reason=ContainerCreating，restarts=0。\n\n2. **根因指向 Multus Networ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788433951080, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

