缺少 'unavailable-network' NetworkAttachmentDefinition 资源 → Multus CNI 插件执行 add 操作时报错 'NoNetworkFound' → Kubelet 调用 CNI 失败导致 PodSandbox 创建被拒 → Pod 状态持续卡在 ContainerCreating\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：Pod `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v` 配置了不存在的 Multus 网络注解 `unavailable-network`（证据 #1 `fact-001253afb01c`）。这导致 Multus 插件在注入网络时无法找到对应的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` 资源，直接导致容器沙箱创建失败（证据 #2 `fact-61c3f89864cb`），表现为 Pod 无法脱离 `ContainerCreating` 状态（证据 #3 `fact-ea24f1277a13`）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 23.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 47.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v: 47.6s (Evidence 38.4s, RCA 8.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 11.3s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-nhd7v**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 82.234, "metrics": {"run_id": "cad943094bad4a91", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 82.24940395355225, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.9, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0